PROGRAM_OBJECTIVE:
Update the City’s current
ADU Ordinance;

Prepare pre-approved ADU design templates;

Promote development of ADUs through City website and informational material;

Monitor the production and affordability of ADUs annually to ensure the City is meeting the assumption of 66 ADUs per year as outlined in this Housing Element;

Identify and implement potential incentives to encourage production of affordable ADUs;

Host an annual workshop on ADUs.
